        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>The pink-plumed chocobo that can mend wounds. The pink chocobo is very common in the plains or through breeding.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 13, touch 11; flat-footed 11 (+2 dex, +2 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 24 [38] (3d10+8)</p><p>Fort +6, Ref +5, Will +3</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed 60 ft.</p><p>Melee Bite +6 (1d8+4), Talon +6 (1d6+4)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 10 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Choco Thunder</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 18, Dex 14, Con 15, Int 2, Wis 14, Cha 6</p><p>Base Atk +3; CMB +8; CMD 20</p><p>Feats Endurance, Run</p><p>Skills Acrobatics +9, Perception +9, Survival +3</p><p>SQ Choco Cure, Glide, Tame</p>"
